#------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------    
#   Name			: s_laadisbmn007.scr
#   Description		: Additional charges are collected after disbursment
#   Date			: 02-04-2013
#   Author			: Sateesh
#   Input			: NA
#   Output			: NA
#   Called Script	:
#   Calling Script	: getcparamvalue.scr, laadisbmn006.scr
#   Menu Option		:
